<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thomas-coral-calice-septa-insertion-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Milne-Edwards & Haime (1848), Kunth (1869) & Chindapol et al. (2013) Scleractinian coral calice septal insertion & advection-diffusion morphogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements Milne-Edwards & Haime (1848) hexameral septal doubling N_hex(k) = 6 * 2^(k-1) triggered at perimeter threshold 2*pi*R_k = N_hex(k)*lambda_s, decreasing radial reach L_k/R = alpha_k, Kunth's Law (1869) Paleozoic Rugosa serial 4-fossula insertion N_rugosa(m) = 6 + 4*m, and Chindapol et al. (2013) Péclet advection-diffusion boundary-layer flux modulation with a Pe = 0 pure-diffusion radial symmetry negative control. Backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_074_coral_calice_septa_insertion.lean`." ;
